Package: MultiOmicsCancer
Title: Methylation-Based Prognostic Scoring and Multi-Omics Analysis for Cancer Research
Version: 0.99.4
Authors@R: 
    person("Maryam", "Emami",
           email = "maryam.emami1499@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-7710-3274"))
Description: A modular framework for integrative analysis of DNA methylation
    and gene expression data in cancer research. The package provides
    functions for differential methylation analysis, differential
    expression analysis, methylation-expression correlation, survival
    analysis, and construction and validation of methylation-based
    prognostic scores. Data from cBioPortal and TCGA can be loaded via
    cBioPortalData and curatedTCGAData, and any MultiAssayExperiment
    object can be used directly as input.
